WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
I was born and raised right
here, in this part of town.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.550
I'd love to see Herăstrău Park
brought back to how it used to be.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.350
Beautiful.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.950
With roses.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.095
With flowers you just don't see any more.

6
00:00:14.145 --> 00:00:15.350
Everything was so clean.

7
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.150
Everyone came out for
a stroll, first of all…

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.350
all the artists who lived
along Aleea Primăverii.

9
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.050
I was born and bred in this area.

10
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.466
And everyone brought their dogs.

11
00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:32.050
It was such a happy place, really lovely.

12
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.050
Mostly we came to Herăstrău
Park and to the Floreasca lido.

13
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.250
There was a restaurant and
there were swimming pools.

14
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.450
I was about ten years old at the time.

15
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.958
And all the pools that used to be here…

16
00:00:47.008 --> 00:00:48.850
the swimming complex was beautiful.

17
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.850
Under Ceaușescu we weren't allowed
to set foot on the path, because…

18
00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.050
he was out on the lake in his motorboat.

19
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.250
And only we, the lifeguards,
were allowed there,

20
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.250
and even we couldn't go past the buoy.

21
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.250
And it was incredibly beautiful.

22
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.250
It was so peaceful. Life was worth living.

